    // ===== Certificate proof-phase gate seed (seed_state_from_config) =====

    /// Post-feature metadata (stamped at Init/InitFromConfig): the engine
    /// flag is enabled at seed time.

    /// Pre-feature metadata (flag absent ⇒ serde default false): the seed
    /// leaves the engine flag off, so `replay_to_event_count` over a
    /// pre-feature event log offers TheoremStating dispatch
    /// byte-identically to the original run.

    /// The seed is set-only: a state piped through Init{state} that
    /// already carries the flag keeps it even under pre-feature metadata.

    /// W7: post-feature metadata seeds the deferred-certificate
    /// stuck-audit trigger; pre-feature metadata leaves it off (replay
    /// byte-identity); the seed is set-only.

    /// B2 freshness guard covers the coverage source too: a mid-run state
    /// piped through Init{state} arms nothing, both gates set.
